    "identifier": "fire-release-explosive-clone",
    "description": "<p>You conjure a clone comprised of Fire release chakra, made to look exactly like you called an Explosive Clone. When this jutsu is cast, by spending 9 chakra, you summon one Clone. You can spend 6 additional chakra to summon 1 additional Clone. You can spend 6 additional chakra in this way to summon additional Clones up to 3 times per casting.</p>\n<p>This clone cannot use Clone Strike and can only cast jutsu with the Fire Release keyword. When this clones hit points are reduced to 0, it detonates.</p>\n<p>Detonate. All creatures within 15 feet of the clone must make a Dexterity saving throw, taking 5d6+5 Fire damage, gaining 1 rank of the Burned, are pushed back 10 feet and fall prone. On a successful save the they only take half damage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above C-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 1d6+1.</p>",
